WEBVTT

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:10.007
Slaný. Thirty-five minutes by bus from the Prague metro.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:24.113
A few steps from the park stand Viladům and Byty Borovského, and the
first phase of Verde. Next to them, another building is rising from
the drawings.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:40.789
This is where the second phase of Verde Slaný is rising. Five floors
and forty-eight apartments, from studios to three-bedroom units, each
with a balcony, a terrace or a front garden.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:47.233
And sixty-seven parking spaces in front of the building.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:57.436
This is how a furnished two-bedroom apartment can look. A living room
with kitchen, a bedroom and a bathroom with a tub.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:08.308
A few steps from your door, you’re in the park. Kumpán Garden with its
avenues and fountain, and in summer, the outdoor pool right next door.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:21.508
The town centre and shops are a ten-minute walk away. And by car, via
the D7 motorway now being completed, you reach the Prague ring road in
twenty minutes.

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:29.401
And this is just the beginning. Building permits for three more
buildings have already been issued.

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:39.367
Completion is planned for 2028, and you only pay ten percent until
completion. Verde Slaný, phase two.

